1
00:00:02,032 --> 00:00:10,204
Fractal Future Fantasy: The Wrinkle-Rumble! Where identity changed, changes, and might change into dust!

2
00:00:12,197 --> 00:00:18,134
Did you hear of The Proboscis of Doom, Eavesdrop? You will hear every insult whispered by youth.

3
00:00:18,971 --> 00:00:24,955
The Chatter-Chompers, Swap Equipment: steal item, give Gingivitis. Accidentally wearing your enemy's smile.

4
00:00:25,757 --> 00:00:32,780
Nobody warned us about The Wrinkle-Storm, Collision: do not complete mission, you age instantly. Diaper remains constant.

5
00:00:33,895 --> 00:00:38,641
The Foliage of Shame, Clog: fast food leads to legacy of posterior facial hair.

6
00:00:39,265 --> 00:00:43,324
The Squint-of Goggles, Misread: future bright. Too bad you can't see it.

7
00:00:43,874 --> 00:00:49,614
The Phantom Waistline, Space Hog: push people away, grow old alone. And by alone, we mean wide.

8
00:00:50,506 --> 00:00:56,694
The Toupee of Denial, Camouflage: everyone knows it's a squirrel. Graceful aging, myth sold by hat salesmen.

9
00:00:56,714 --> 00:01:03,622
Not a metaphor: The Creaky-Knees Caliper. Rust. Predict rain with your joints. Mind wants to tango, cartilage wants to crumble.

10
00:01:03,642 --> 00:01:08,497
The Bicker-of Bunker, Stalemate: seventy years, still haven't decided who gets top bunk.

11
00:01:09,197 --> 00:01:15,710
Ever tasted The Cookie of Causality, Inciting Incident? Restart game, keep all damage. War started over snickerdoodle.

12
00:01:15,730 --> 00:01:22,677
The Salad Dressing Divider, Petty Theft: claim it was yours for 40 years. Robots still listen to us argue about condiments.

13
00:01:22,697 --> 00:01:27,678
The Unsent Apology, Regret: he died hating you. You win argument, but lose soul.

14
00:01:27,698 --> 00:01:36,388
This one has a rule: The Strike-Forever of Sign. Filibuster. If you stop, you lose. Dismantle establishment, even if decomposing.

15
00:01:36,408 --> 00:01:40,812
The Wheelchair Joust: chivalry isn't dead, just on life support and very angry.

16
00:01:40,832 --> 00:01:46,252
You know The Grudge-Tree, Entanglement: if you fall, they fall. Stuck in tree 70 years with Harold.

17
00:01:46,272 --> 00:01:50,992
No wait, The Loop of Blame, Recursion: your fault. No, my fault. No, your fault for making it my fault.

18
00:01:51,012 --> 00:01:57,450
Before we continue, The Skeleton of Waiter, Hold Music: Madame Foster just finishing up. In craft aisle for three decades.

19
00:01:57,470 --> 00:02:03,437
Welcome to The Slide of Eternity, Gravity Trap: keep arms and legs inside existential dread.

20
00:02:03,457 --> 00:02:08,413
The Unanswered Riddle, Analysis Paralysis: if you win, keep playing. Only winning move is to be wrong.

21
00:02:08,433 --> 00:02:13,516
The Sock-Phone, Nonsense Call: I made a brother! Smells like feet, listens to my screams.

22
00:02:13,536 --> 00:02:18,504
The 40th Grade of Desk, Held Back: repeat tutorial. Always next year. Mr. Ratburn immortal.

23
00:02:18,524 --> 00:02:23,135
I used to believe The Safe Path of Grave, Caution: heart beat perfectly until it died of boredom.

24
00:02:23,155 --> 00:02:31,052
Anyway, The Unfinished Script, Procrastination: art is 1% inspiration, 99% staring at wall until you die.

25
00:02:31,072 --> 00:02:37,263
You with the card in your hand, The Participation Trophy, Validation: you showed up. Extent of your contribution to history.

26
00:02:37,283 --> 00:02:42,831
Let me tell you about The Pink Slip Robot, Automation: future efficient. You are not. Please vacate premises.

27
00:02:42,851 --> 00:02:47,755
The Laser Cane, Tech Upgrade: you forget who you are attacking. Hunt doesn't require aim, just batteries.

28
00:02:47,775 --> 00:02:52,379
The Gym Teacher's Hell, Payback: weak shall inherit gym, gym teacher shall inherit hernia.

29
00:02:52,399 --> 00:02:57,091
The thing about The Hover-Diaper, Levitation: science conquered gravity solely to deal with incontinence.

30
00:02:57,111 --> 00:03:01,301
The Garbage Kingdom, Scavenge: nanny throws you out, you become King of Dump.

31
00:03:01,321 --> 00:03:05,864
The Retainer Party, Isolation: Happy 100th Birthday. Only friend, piece of dental wire.

32
00:03:05,884 --> 00:03:12,100
Have you heard of The Abyss Home, Institutionalize? They are safe now. Soup warm, doors locked from outside.

33
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:15,944
The Zero-G Rocker, Drift: rocking back and forth, only propulsion left.

34
00:03:15,964 --> 00:03:21,094
I once met The Pearly Gatekeeper, Judgment: reveal your hand. Any Stolen Items, lose game.

35
00:03:21,114 --> 00:03:25,681
The Empty Dance Floor, Nostalgia: music stopped forty years ago, but feet keep moving.

36
00:03:25,701 --> 00:03:30,207
The Dream-Bubble Pop, Wake Up: all a dream. Terrible, wrinkly, arthritis-filled dream.

37
00:03:30,227 --> 00:03:34,883
The Reset Button, Meta-Strike: plot too depressing? Complain to writers until they drop anvil.

38
00:03:35,193 --> 00:03:39,835
Do you know The Denial Visor? If you can't see it, it isn't happening. Ultimate defense against reality.

39
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:42,626
The Grudge Anchor: why move forward when you can stay here and be angry?

40
00:03:43,496 --> 00:03:46,894
The Nap-Time Hammer, Dream Sequence: for when young people are too loud.

41
00:03:47,075 --> 00:03:50,894
The deck insists on The 4th Wall Brick: rewrite one card with marker. Escape medium.

42
00:03:51,137 --> 00:03:54,761
The Fountain of Old: bathroom breaks double. Drink deep, feel your bones liquefy.

43
00:03:55,106 --> 00:03:58,720
Remember The Memory Lane Minefield: watch your step. That's where you called your teacher Mom.

44
00:03:58,740 --> 00:04:02,709
The What-If Window, Depression: look at life you could have had. Now look at your hand. Cry.

45
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:09,546
Meanwhile elsewhere, The Paradox Playground: time flows in reverse. Fun for whole family, assuming family hasn't been erased.

46
00:04:10,154 --> 00:04:14,729
What if The Glitch-Beast, Chaos, shuffles all discard piles into new deck? It hurts to exist.

47
00:04:15,212 --> 00:04:18,905
You played The Eraser, Delete: tear up one card. Only permanent cure for aging.

48
00:04:19,468 --> 00:04:23,242
Did you ever try The Blank Cheque, Bluff? Pretend you have winning card. Value subjective.

49
00:04:23,708 --> 00:04:29,708
Which brings us to Uncle FrizzleBob's Exit, Resign: flip table. Go outside. Play outside. You're still old. Go home.

50
00:04:30,050 --> 00:04:41,412
Stay Fluffy!
